### HyperGrid API - Crash Test Pipeline
### Gunakan VS Code REST Client atau JetBrains HTTP Client untuk menjalankan file ini.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000/api
@deviceId = dev-pixel-7-tester

### ==========================================================================
### SCENARIO 1: Driver 1 Melewati Jl. Sudirman dan mendeteksi Pothole A
### ==========================================================================

# @name createDriver1Detection
POST {{baseUrl}}/detections
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "deviceId": "{{deviceId}}-driver-1",
  "latitude": -6.208800,
  "longitude": 106.845600,
  "confidence": 0.85,
  "speedKmh": 45.0,
  "zAccelPeak": 3.85,
  "modelVersion": "v1.0",
  "detectedAt": "2026-09-01T12:00:00.000Z"
}

### ==========================================================================
### SCENARIO 2: Cek Bounding Box Peta
### Ekspektasi: Muncul 1 Pothole Cluster di titik Jl. Sudirman (detection_count: 1)
### ==========================================================================

# @name checkBoundingBox1
GET {{baseUrl}}/pothole-clusters?minLat=-6.2200&minLon=106.8300&maxLat=-6.2000&maxLon=106.8600&status=active
Accept: application/json

### ==========================================================================
### SCENARIO 3: Driver 2 Melewati lubang yang SAMA (Jarak hanya selisih 5 meter dari titik pertama)
### Backend HANYA boleh melakukan update cluster (Auto Clustering)
### ==========================================================================

# @name createDriver2Detection
POST {{baseUrl}}/detections
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "deviceId": "{{deviceId}}-driver-2",
  "latitude": -6.208820,
  "longitude": 106.845620,
  "confidence": 0.95,
  "speedKmh": 50.0,
  "zAccelPeak": 4.20,
  "modelVersion": "v1.0",
  "detectedAt": "2026-09-01T12:30:00.000Z"
}

### ==========================================================================
### SCENARIO 4: Cek Bounding Box Peta Lagi
### Ekspektasi: JUMLAH Cluster tetap 1, tapi `detection_count` naik jadi 2, dan `confidence_avg` berubah (rata-rata 0.85 & 0.95 menjadi 0.90)
### ==========================================================================

# @name checkBoundingBox2
GET {{baseUrl}}/pothole-clusters?minLat=-6.2200&minLon=106.8300&maxLat=-6.2000&maxLon=106.8600&status=active
Accept: application/json
